### Shipping and Last-Mile Delivery Overview

As of October 2023, Green Freight Logistics has successfully expanded its shipping operations across the Midwest, significantly boosting our freight delivery capabilities. Our partnership with Swift Trucking Co. has enabled us to optimize our routes, reducing average delivery times by 15%. With a fleet of 150 trucks, including 50 electric vehicles, we are committed to sustainability while ensuring efficient transport of goods.

Our last-mile delivery system, powered by the Nexus Delivery App, has increased customer satisfaction ratings to 92% in Q3 2023. This app allows our delivery personnel, including the 30 drivers from Urban Express, to track real-time delivery metrics and customer feedback.

